{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684820/extras/78a53b3d0248edbafd1d9e6f60620643.avif?t=1766838857\" width=800 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Prime World Classic Community welcomes you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prime World is a free online RPG/MOBA game with a unique universe, combining tactical session-based battles, castle management, and heroes. We\u2019ve come together to recreate your favorite game in a refreshed form!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of two castle designs upon registration;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and create deadly talent combinations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free access to all previously existing hero skins;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero rankings;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve victories on the battlefields of Praia.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible variety of talents and skins allows everyone to create a unique character tailored to their playstyle! As the server evolves, new castle development and combat features await you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u041f\u0435\u0440\u0432\u043e\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0435\u0446","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3684820/86d0fbf3e3ff04abc8c77be9248e38f7c56dbcc3.jpg"},{"name":"\u0411\u043e\u0435\u0432\u043e\u0435 \u043a\u0440\u0435\u0449\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 - \u041f\u043e\u0433\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0447\u044c\u0435","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3684820/35a60e5209ddbba206f4a047393f6c9b0a8c7eb3.jpg"},{"name":"\u041f\u0435\u0440\u0432\u043e\u0435 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043e\u0447\u0430\u0440\u0